Tickets closed:
CORE-T1: HeaterConfig::with_defaults() with real device values
CORE-T2: CycleResult voltage_start/voltage_end, start_heating_with_voltage, finalize_with_voltage
CORE-T3: CUTOFF_DISABLED=420 documented and enforced
CORE-T4: HeatingMode enum as domain type
CORE-T5: Preset::target_temp() and power() const methods
CORE-T6: ConsumptionData::record_cycle exactly-once contract
CORE-T7: DomainEvent::SessionUpdate { clicks, last_click, session_start }
CORE-T8: DomainEvent::HeartbeatSent
